 "paragraphs": [
  "As the falcon sailed through the sky, Aliya and Zade trekked across rocks and sandy slopes. They made a turn at the first tree where they found the red fox lounging under the sun.",
  "“Hello there,” Zade greeted the fox. “Can we have the first riddle for the password to the party?”",
  "The red fox nodded. “Listen carefully. I exist where you stand. I provide a haven for birds and other animals. I store carbon and release oxygen. I can live off saltwater. How many of me do you see?”"
 ],
